{"id":"97a96c59c5234b71","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Numerical Predicates","display":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Numerical Predicates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","aliases":["57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate"],"display":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Numerical Predicates","depends_on":["[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Numerical Predicates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq D_k\">\\(P\\subseteq D_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_k,\\operatorname{pack}_k\">\\(D_k,\\operatorname{pack}_k\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\vec x)\">\\(P(\\vec x)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in P\">\\(\\vec x\\in P\\)</span> 的成员谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 的分量展开按打包映射解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\subseteq D_k\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\;\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n[\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y)=0)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\subseteq D_k\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\;\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n[\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y)=0)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的见证函数全定义；RE_k 是数值谓词的半判定性，不是公式语法集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$P\\subseteq D_k$；$D_k,\\operatorname{pack}_k$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。$P(\\vec x)$ 是 $\\vec x\\in P$ 的成员谓词；$\\vec x$ 的分量展开按打包映射解释。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$P\\subseteq D_k$；$D_k,\\operatorname{pack}_k$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。$P(\\vec x)$ 是 $\\vec x\\in P$ 的成员谓词；$\\vec x$ 的分量展开按打包映射解释。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq D_k","display":false},{"tex":"D_k,\\operatorname{pack}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\subseteq D_k\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\;\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n[\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle)\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y)=0)].","display":true}],"bytes":1094,"backlinks":[{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["7463e44f61370c84","4bf1a2a7d352c15e"]}